<title>UK: Bradford &amp; Bingley B/S prices 125 million stg bond.</title>
<headline>Bradford &amp; Bingley B/S prices 125 million stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bradford and Bingley Building Society's 125 million stg subordinated callable bond has been priced, joint leads HSBC Markets and SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>The deal was launched earlier on Monday.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   COUPON     8.375     MATURITY   *27.DEC.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.719    PAY DATE    07.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    99.719    SPREAD	+85 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.50 PCT GILT DUE 2006</p>
<p> NOTES     *CALL AT PAR AFTER 10 YEARS. IF NOT CALLED THE COUPON</p>
<p>		WILL BE RESET HIGHER IF NECESSARY TO YIELD +185 BP.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
